/Keywords (Chaos; one-dimensional dynamics; higher dimensional dynamics; complex dynamics; Mandelbrot set; Julia set; Robert L. Devaney)
/ModDate (D:20211006182035+05'30')
/Producer (GPL Ghostscript 9.16)
/Subject (This widely used graduate text introduces modern topics in dynamical systems. The author includes new material on complex dynamics leading to key revisions. Striking color photos illustrating both Julia and Mandelbrot sets are included. This book assumes no prior acquaintance with advanced mathematical topics.)
/Title (An Introduction to Chaotic Dynamical Systems)
